Muse Glimmer (Meta)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does not contain Muse Glimmer weights. Its scripts download,
run, fine-tune and convert them, and its release artifacts include a model
derived from them:

  * dflash-tuned-lr2e-05-Q4_K_M.gguf and the matching bf16 safetensors
    checkpoint: a fine-tune of meta-models/Muse-Glimmer-30B-assistant
    (revision e8192f3a8f617f74be2ce220360c89ef4789f39f), trained on hidden
    states and greedy outputs of the Muse Glimmer 30B target.

Muse Glimmer models and their released artifacts are provided by Meta under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that licence, as published with
the model, is in licenses/GLIMMER-LICENSE.

Use of Muse Glimmer, and of any model derived from it, is also subject to the
Muse Glimmer Usage Policy. A copy, as published with the model, is in
licenses/GLIMMER-USAGE-POLICY.md. The current version is at
https://huggingface.co/meta-models/Muse-Glimmer-30B/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY.md

Anyone who redistributes the tuned drafter must keep this notice, the
Apache-2.0 licence and the Usage Policy with it, and must state that the
model was modified from Meta's release.

