-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

UltraChat 200k (HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k), MIT License. The drafter
training prompts include 500 first turns from its train_sft split;
examples/prompts_eval.jsonl includes 5 first turns from its test_sft split.

All other example data (fictional personas, the synthetic day in
qlora/fixtures/, the synthetic general slice) was generated for this project
and contains no real personal data.

