Runtimes and libraries (used, not vendored)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party source code is copied into this repository. The scripts call
or import these projects, each under its own licence:

  llama.cpp (ggml-org)                MIT
  MLX, MLX-LM (Apple)                 MIT
  Hugging Face transformers,
    tokenizers, safetensors,
    accelerate, peft, trl, datasets   Apache-2.0
  PyTorch                             BSD-3-Clause
  bitsandbytes                        MIT
  Unsloth                             Apache-2.0

The drafter training recipe follows the DFlash paper (arXiv:2602.06036,
CC BY 4.0) and the SpecForge DFlash objective; no code from either is
included.
